command-description-skills-set_level = Sets the entity's skill level
command-description-skills-add_exp = Adds experience to the entity's skill
command-description-skills-show = Lists the skills of the piped entities: the levels as they are and with the modifiers, and the experience.
command-description-skills-explain = Says everything about the skill check of a query for the piped user, the used entity and the target (their ids), without doing it: the checks that were looked at and why they fit, the chosen one, the variables, every step of the formulas, the chances, the experience and the effects.
command-description-skills-overview = Says for each query which skill and which check the piped user would perform for the used entity and the target (their ids), and why not.
command-description-skills-roll = Really does the skill check of a query for the piped user, the used entity and the target (their ids): the experience is given and the effects are applied. Says the result and the experience.
